WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
09:00 — Currency glance. Omar’s phone dashboard shows AED and GBP sample balances before the first client call — multi-currency without opening three banking apps.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
11:30 — Cards check. On the sofa he reviews cards on the iPad before lunch, expiry dates visible, no glovebox archaeology.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
16:00 — Export on laptop. Laptop writes an encrypted .vos backup to a disk he owns — new phone week, no cloud rent, no “upload everything” pitch.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
19:20 — Security review. Security settings on the laptop get a once-over before the swap: demo labeled, passphrase habits intact.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:00 — Phone ready. New phone restores from the backup; the sample vault opens like nothing moved. He smiles at the boring success.

